BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fly Fishing Film Tour
DTSTART:20270204T030000Z
DTEND:20270204T051500Z
DTSTAMP:20270204T030000Z
UID:IcT351othO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nPresented by Skwala and YETI. T
 he Fly Fishing Film Tour (F3T) is back for 2027! Get ready for an unforget
 table night of fly fishing films\, adventure\, and community.Featuring a c
 ollection of independent films from around the world\, F3T celebrates the 
 stories\, destinations\, and people that make fly fishing so special. From
  breathtaking landscapes to unforgettable moments on the water\, the tour 
 brings the excitement of fly fishing to the big screen.Whether you're a li
 felong angler or new to the sport\, F3T is the perfect opportunity to conn
 ect with your local fly fishing community and get inspired for your next a
 dventure. Grab your tickets and join us for the 2027 Fly Fishing Film Tou
 r!\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/fly-fishing-film-tour\n\nEst
 imated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
